  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "### Resource-based tuner admits too many calls\n**Guide:** Failure modes: row 10  \u00b7  **Symptom:** Resource-based tuner admits far more concurrent calls than the API allows.  \u00b7  **Cause:** I/O-bound calls don't move JVM CPU or heap, so the supplier keeps issuing slots.  \u00b7  **Fix:** Fixed-size (or custom) slot supplier for local activities.\n\n**What to watch:** Local activity slots used and API in-flight vs the concurrency limit; concurrency rejections only with the resource-based tuner.\n\n| # | Variant | Phase | Length | What changes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | broken | resource-based LA slots, API 8x slower | 105 s | Demand needs ~47 concurrent calls; the API allows 40 (at SCALE 0.2). |\n| 2 | baseline | recover | 45 s |  |\n| 3 | fixed | fixed-size LA slots, API 8x slower | 105 s | Slots cap the fleet below the API limit; overflow fails fast to 'deferred' in the worker. |\n\nRun it from the [control page](http://localhost:8088). Blue regions mark phases; red markers are crashes and restarts."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "state-timeline",
   "title": "Phase",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
